          "title": "After your ONT run",
          "text": "Start a new methylation-only project. This is the real UI with synthetic files; no analysis is run."
        },
        {
          "start": 5.596947890007868,
          "end": 12.349148779176176,
          "title": "Original sample membership",
          "text": "Choose preservation from specimen records, then discover the original barcode FASTQs. These are synthetic examples."
        },
        {
          "start": 12.349148779176176,
          "end": 27.517124348087236,
          "title": "Name the samples",
          "text": "These fictional tumour samples have leukemia, CNS or unknown clinical context. Assign the main sample role first."
        },
        {
          "start": 27.517124348087236,
          "end": 34.29985363315791,
          "title": "Use original methylation calls",
          "text": "Keep methylation-only analysis. Link the original modified-base BAMs with MM/ML tags, not an ordinary CNA alignment."
        },
        {
          "start": 34.29985363315791,
          "end": 43.42462546704337,
          "title": "POD5 is the alternative",
          "text": "POD5 requires compatible Dorado basecalling and modified-base models. Existing modified-base BAMs avoid basecalling again."
        },
        {
          "start": 43.42462546704337,
          "end": 54.279538626084104,
          "title": "Drag from documented clinical context",
          "text": "Drag leukemia to MARLIN and CNS tumour to Sturgeon. A previous classifier prediction is not the selection rule."
        },
        {
          "start": 54.279538626084104,
          "end": 60.29888505814597,
          "title": "Unknown stays unassigned",
          "text": "Leave unknown or unsuitable clinical context unassigned. The dropdown on each card offers the same accessible choice."
        },
        {
          "start": 60.29888505814597,
          "end": 76.15353217115626,
          "title": "Reuse local tools and reference",
          "text": "Supply installed tool and model paths, or a resource YAML. This demonstration uses synthetic path fixtures, not trained models."
        },
        {
          "start": 76.15353217115626,
          "end": 82.71432776097208,
          "title": "One classifier per project",
          "text": "Choose MARLIN. Only its assigned sample enters this project; the other two are excluded and are not queued."
        },
        {
          "start": 82.71432776097208,
          "end": 87.07602983014658,
          "title": "Separate destination",
          "text": "Save to a new cpg-marlin project. Keep the completed ONT project and the other classifier's project unchanged."
        },
        {
          "start": 87.07602983014658,
          "end": 94.87268273509108,
          "title": "Save and check only",
          "text": "Save the selected group's configuration and inspect the included names. These checks validate synthetic paths, not biological model quality."
        },
        {
